{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52644","headline":"南天路言怀（题拟） · 慧超","name":"南天路言怀（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月夜瞻氜路，浮云飒飒归。\n减书参去便，风急不听回。\n我国天岸北，他邦地角西。\n日南无有雁，谁爲向林飞。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧超","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52644.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52644","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}